      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Modified post to include build 1359, of which after some testing of the update, it still stops responding under the same circumstances but now takes longer for it to happen. Doesn't necessarily needs to be overheated, which in my case it worked fine before the update albeit running very hot (I got a cover and never removed it, even before the update that introduced this bug). Even when not overheated, the game still kept freezing until I force close the application.",
