  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since updating to build 1344+, the game was freezing at different times after playing in less than 30 min, approximately. I did follow the general trobleshooter for mobile alpha (Restarted my phone, uninstalled it multiple times at different versions and is at the latest version [1360]). Unfortunately, it kept occuring despite these measures. \n\n \n\nHow I reproduced the bug:\n\n1. Update app to either build 1344, 1345, 1359 or 1360 (as of October 26th, 2023)\n\n2. Play or idle until the game freezes or stops responding\n\nThe lapse of time which the game stops responding can vary. You may not be able join certain worlds if staying on build 1335 and below.\n\nPhone specs:\n\nPhone Model: Samsung Galaxy S21 Ultra (SM-G998U1)\n\nAndroid Version: Android 13 (originally released with Android 11)\n\nAPI Level: 33\n\nCPU: Qualcomm Snapdragon 888\n\nNumber of cores: 8\n\n• 1 x Kryo 680 Prime (2.8Ghz)\n\n• 3 x Kryo 680 Gold (2.4Ghz)\n\n• 4 x Kryo 680 Silver (1.8Ghz)\n\nGPU: Qualcomm Adreno 660\n\nVulkan 1.3\n\nOpenGL ES 3.2\n\nSet Resolution: WQHD+ (3200 x 1440)\n\nDensity: 680dpi (XXXHDPI)\n\nSet Refresh Rate: 120Hz\n\nProcessor : QTI SM8350",
